    "registration": {
      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "YUNG-chung 永忠 (T. 良甫, 敬軒, H. 蕖仙, 臞仙, 九華道人, 香園, 存齋, etc.), 1735–1793, poet, was a member of the Ch'ing Imperial Family and belonged to the Bordered Blue Banner. He was a great-grandson of Emperor Shêng-tsu, a grandson of Yin-t'i [禵, q.v.], and the eldest son of Hung-ming 弘明 (1705–1767, posthumous name 恭勤).",
